{"t":"000100.KS","n":"Yuhan Corporation","nKo":"유한양행","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":77300.0,"chg":1500.0,"chgPct":0.01979,"prev":75800.0,"dayH":77600.0,"dayL":75200.0,"w52H":122800.0,"w52L":65000.0,"vol":208091,"avgVol":194902,"mcap":5779266469888,"pe":null,"fpe":27.11,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":600.0,"divY":0.0079,"beta":0.4,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","iKo":"의약품 제조업체 - 전문의약품 및 일반의약품","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.yuhan.co.kr","sum":"Yuhan Corporation operates as a pharmaceutical company in South Korea and internationally. It offers manufacturing services, such as custom manufacturing; process research and development of active pharmaceutical products (APIs) and intermediates; kilo and pilot-scale production of APIs and intermediates; commercial production of APIs and intermediates; production of chemical specialties; and analytical method development and regulatory support. The company also provides APIs and intermediates, including antibiotic, anti-thrombotic, anti-hyperlipidemics, and anti-hypertensive; and custom synthesis services through commercial supply in areas of anti-viral, anti-HIV, anti-HCV, anti-biotic, antihistamine, anti-diabetic, ß-lactamase inhibitor, CNS intermediate, PEG-compounds, and others. Yuhan","sumKo":"유한양행은 한국과 해외에서 제약회사로 활동하고 있습니다. 맞춤형 제조와 같은 제조 서비스를 제공합니다. 활성 의약품(API) 및 중간체의 공정 연구 및 개발; API 및 중간체의 킬로 규모 및 파일럿 규모 생산; API 및 중간체의 상업적 생산; 화학 특산품 생산; 분석 방법 개발 및 규제 지원. 이 회사는 또한 항생제, 항혈전제, 항고지혈증제, 항고혈압제를 포함한 API 및 중간체를 제공합니다. 항바이러스제, 항HIV제, 항HCV제, 항생제, 항히스타민제, 항당뇨병제, β-락타마제 억제제, CNS 중간체, PEG 화합물 등의 분야에 상업적 공급을 통한 맞춤형 합성 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 유한"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":1775846940000,"ni":95144300000},{"y":2023,"rev":1809082040000,"ni":142547380000},{"y":2024,"rev":2008355120000,"ni":70687450000},{"y":2025,"rev":2105660560000,"ni":185319000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":5289